# project.done

Completed: 2026-09-15 (THE FINAL BLITZ), by the repo agent.

## What shipped (v0.2.1, release commit 15cdc41, tag v0.2.1, GitHub Release Latest)

- The snapshot CI canary restored after being permanently red and
  invisible since 2026-08-09: defgroup + :group on the no-op LSP face,
  when-let*, continue-on-error dropped, setup-emacs SHA-pinned at
  v8.0, checkout SHA-pinned at v7.0.1, read-only permissions block,
  v* tag triggers (verified live: the tag push ran CI), a new Emacs
  30.2 job, and make load / make load-wave replacing CI's inline
  evals. All four legs green on the release commit.
- Eight vterm-color-bright-* faces per theme (bright SGR no longer
  unthemed; upstream term[9..16]).
- The family's core contract enforced at last:
  kdn-faces/dragon-and-wave-face-sets-identical (560 = 560 after the
  integration pass; generalizes to Lotus unchanged).
- Theme palette lookups routed through the erroring
  kanagawa-dragon-nvim-color: a typo now fails loudly at load.
- Version-header sync test: five places, one number, enforced.
- Comment-truth batch: shared-palette membership (fujiWhite, fujiGray,
  waveAqua1 are Wave-only), flycheck-posframe comment, and the
  modifier-bleed rationale corrected in helper docstring, README, and
  CLAUDE.md.
- Dragon's solaire-default-face changed to dragonBlack1 (upstream
  bg_dim), Brandon's gated call (2026-09-15): Dragon and Wave now
  darken real buffers alike; live in his Doom after SPC h r r.
- Integration face pass: 69 rows per theme (avy, consult, embark,
  transient, ediff, smerge), spec section first, identical face set in
  both variants.
- tests/sample.rs (compiles and runs; verified with rustc).
- MELPA prep without the flip: package-lint clean except one
  documented alias exception, recipe drafted in the README, repo
  description/topics cover Wave, family-neutral alias
  kanagawa-nvim-neutralize-lsp-modifier-bleed added (prefixed name
  stays canonical).
- Audit hygiene: LICENSE widened to Dragon and Wave; spec machine path
  genericized; README em-dashes recast; the four dead lsp-face-semhl
  rows annotated as harmless pins; .claude relic deleted and
  gitignored; both unused v0.1.0-era PNGs removed (83% of tracked
  bytes); make clean covers *.eln.
- Suite: 42 to 47 tests, all green; byte-compile clean under
  warnings-as-errors on 29.1, 29.4, 30.2, and snapshot.

